g a potential shift in Delhi's underworld dynamics.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qaedbWERmNPhDLNPtq0B7YRZzhN.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TdWx0YW4tb2YtRGVsaGktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAyMyUyOS8.1.4","title":"Bombay Confidential","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Arjun proposes to Sanjana. Jagan assigns Arjun and Bangali a challenging mission in Bombay to secure their future. Meanwhile, in Delhi, RP plots against Arjun.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5P0QbiyfV4dMPAmmJ4rtxqyQBfy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TdWx0YW4tb2YtRGVsaGktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAyMyUyOS8.1.5","title":"Rules of the Game","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With Arjun in jail, RP makes a move to draw Sanjana in his clutches. When she learns Arjun's truth, she must make a tough decision.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n1KoxeLiSSrqLUDzJUV9OoPo0SY.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TdWx0YW4tb2YtRGVsaGktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAyMyUyOS8.1.6","title":"Nights in White Satin","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In Calcutta, Arjun and Bangali meet Nayantara, the city's heartthrob. Forced into a corner, Jagan finally meets his nemesis, revealing a glimpse of his past and altering his future.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4NO5U9dG8xno0zahwHofcKF0fAp.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TdWx0YW4tb2YtRGVsaGktJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAyMyUyOS8.1.7","title":"The Crown","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As RP conspires with Home Minister Jamna Prasad to raid Jagan's warehouses, Arjun races against time to protect their empire. However, a greater threat looms in Etawah.","thumbnail":"https://image